llow these steps:=0A                                                &lt;/stron=
g&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Select the=
 Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                                   =
                 Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A       =
                                             scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A               =
                                 &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers,=
 then choose the=0A                                                    one =
you want to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A                     =
                               to remove the printer later, just highlight =
it and=0A                                                    select Remove.=
&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;h3 c=
lass=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                         =
                       &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                         =
           1.Prepare your printer:=0A                                      =
          &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p=
&gt;Use the instructions that came with your printer to=0A                    =
